          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musani yayu qooda lafa gosa Manase ta ilaboruti keenne, worra isaani gula, aka worri d'aalu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lafti worra haga Mahanaimu ejite, Bashanile ch'ufati ejite lafa hayyuuni Oguni ka Bashani fideefi ammalle ollowaani Yairi jaatama ta Bashani keesa jirtuleti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ammalle lafa Gileadi ta haga garitifi dira Ashtarothifi Edrei, dira gudda hayyu Ogu ka Bashani ejite. Dira kana ch'ufa yayu worra gosa Manase ta gari ta Makiri ilma Manase iraa baate kennani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aki Musani lafa Yerikofi Yordani ilaboru gargari qoode, gaafa inni diida Moabu keesa jiru, akana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
